1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Hey, are you coming to the party tonight?

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,000
I don't know. I have to work early tomorrow.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
(in Spanish) ¿Mamá, dónde están mis llaves?

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,000
They're on the table, mijo. ¡Ándale!

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Thanks. Okay, what time does it start?

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,000
Around eight. Bring something to drink, ¿sí?

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,000
Sure. Do you want me to pick you up?

8
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,000
No, I'll walk. It's not that far from here.

9
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,000
(speaking Spanish) Sí, señora, ya voy, ya voy.

10
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Sorry, that was my neighbor. Where were we?

11
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,000
The party. Eight o'clock. Don't be late this time.

12
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,000
I'm never late. Well, almost never.
